WEBVTT

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.490
I've never done it before, but I'll do it now.

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.280
I've got to be kidding...

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:22.950
Shyness and bewilderment, should I add up those experiences?

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:25.170
Even if I've seen some things, I'll turn a blind eye to them.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.880
They disappear with a flicker.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:33.070
I imagine the afterimage with an intense movie.

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:38.430
I unintentionally blurt out, "I kind of like you."

00:00:38.490 --> 00:00:41.680
I have a temperature and a cold coming on.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:44.170
It's no-no-normal.

00:00:44.260 --> 00:00:48.650
When the contradictions come to an end, a white horse appears.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:51.360
How strange! How strange!

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:54.980
You look like the prince!

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:57.660
The regret from the kiss won't disappear.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:01.610
Why did you give it to me even though it's just puppy love?

00:01:01.610 --> 00:01:05.080
We should start over at the least.

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:08.210
It's not over. The kiss was passionate.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:12.290
It was just too sudden, so what should we do?

00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:15.720
Quickly, the horse from before!

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:19.840
Should we ride away? Just the two of us? And then leave it?

00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:21.680
No, no, no.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:25.620
What I really want is for us to make

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:27.770
a secret plan!

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:55.250
We heard about it from Amaji. Seems like you guys spent the night at Tenkuuji's house.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.910
Even Kochikaze was...

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:58.570
Melon-chan as well...

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.580
Why is it only you...

00:01:59.780 --> 00:02:01.590
Melon doesn't matter, does she?

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:04.420
More importantly, if you guys come any closer,

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:06.920
my defense system won't keep quiet.

00:02:08.230 --> 00:02:10.330
What about your defense system?

00:02:12.620 --> 00:02:16.270
You dented can! What kind of entrance is that?

00:02:16.270 --> 00:02:18.220
If you're going to attack from behind, you need-

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:21.500
What did you mean by "Melon doesn't matter, does she?" Bakakeru.

00:02:21.500 --> 00:02:22.960
Don't attach such cliché names to me!

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:28.910
In short, you are a selfish dented can which immediately uses violence.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:29.870
That's why-

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.010
Melon Punch!

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:37.360
All right, everyone tidy up. The teacher is coming.

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:42.410
Huh? It feels like someone is missing.

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.860
I can't sense his presence, is it my imagination?

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:47.080
Kochikaze-san...

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.490
I'll remember this, dented can.

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:52.260
Now, Melon-chan, you should take your seat.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:53.770
You're right.

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.170
I'm Kizaki.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:14.930
I will be teaching mathematics in the place of Adachi-sensei, who is currently hospitalized. Please bear with me.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:21.170
What in the world are you thinking? Was this that pervert's idea?

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:25.610
If you mean whether these are Otoya-san's orders or not, you are correct.

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:30.160
Besides being qualified to be a secretary, I also have a teaching license. There should be no problems.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.930
Tell us your goals. Is it something related to Melon?

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:39.240
Yes. I am here to observe you two as well as another owner in this school.

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:40.970
What was that?!

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:43.830
T-There's another owner in this school?

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:47.030
Yes. Though I can't say who it is...

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:51.940
There will definitely be a risk if you stay at school.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.080
Excuse me.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:59.800
How dare she become our teacher!

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:05.100
If she has that intention, then I too will prepare for lesson reviews on extracurricular teaching immediately and diligently

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.570
...with great attention to detail while wearing panties on my head.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:11.270
This is a male student's eternal romance!

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:14.990
Wait, were you even listening? Now is not the time to be thinking about that.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:16.680
Yeah, you're right.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:20.740
For the time being, I think it's better I don't come here.

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:21.990
No, it's all right.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:26.230
Besides, the probability of bringing an Akikan to school is low.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:30.030
Even if the other can is brought here, we still have the radar.

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:34.160
You're right, but if the other party discovers us first, what do we do?

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:38.350
If we have contact, we can talk. Then we can figure out the other party's intentions.

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.320
I am a genius!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.040
Since that's decided, we should start our preparations soon.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:04:59.420
Kakeru-chan.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:02.390
The rumbling of the sea is calling me.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:03.610
Kakeru-chan?

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:04.840
Ahh, it's Najimi.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:09.780
Hey, hey. About this Sunday's date...

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:12.090
There's an interesting love movie being shown.

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.650
It's called "Electromagnetic Girlfriend."

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.290
Er, about that...

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.420
What's wrong?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.640
Sorry. It turns out that I can't make it.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:27.170
O-Oh. You have something to do? Then how about next Sunday?

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:32.680
No, I probably can't go for a while. Sorry, it's really something important.

00:05:33.010 --> 00:05:34.860
Is that so...

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:38.670
I see. Then I guess it can't be helped.

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:39.980
Kakeru!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.950
The north wind is calling me!

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:47.340
What are you doing? If you don't hurry up, everyone will be gone.

00:05:47.340 --> 00:05:50.090
Melon? That won't be good. I must hurry up then.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:51.970
Najimi, sorry.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:53.280
Y-Yeah!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.270
All right, let's go. Be careful, Melon.

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:08.300
Let the aluminum can's owner's Akikan radar react so we can lure them out. Understood?

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.330
I got it. Then I'll change back into a can.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:19.390
Why are they in lovey-dovey mode?

00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:24.070
Isn't it part of school tradition to not have good fortune with exciting youth?!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:27.610
It's... It's not good here. Let's change locations.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:27.990
Yeah.

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:32.780
What?! Here as well?!

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:36.860
Mutual consent? Is it mutual consent? Why is it only happening today?

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:39.280
What is with this school?

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.350
We'll be fine here. All right, here it goes, Melon.

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.170
Y-Yeah.

00:06:46.930 --> 00:06:51.210
What is this weird hesitation? Don't be affected strangely by what you just saw.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.930
This is not a kiss. It's necessary.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:58.030
It's the process that is necessary for carrying out the plan successfully-

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:01.730
I get it! Hurry up and do it! Someone will come!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.180
W-W-Why didn't you kick away me as usual?

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:21.570
W-What? So if I don't kick you, you won't back off?!

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:24.040
Didn't you first say something like

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:27.220
"Uh, Uh," in a happy and shy manner?

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:30.680
Isn't that your own delusional fantasy?

00:07:30.680 --> 00:07:34.810
Come on, concentrate. We don't know when and where the enemy will come out.

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:36.560
Oh, I got it.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:43.700
Hey...

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.410
W-What?

00:07:46.130 --> 00:07:48.660
If the other person doesn't come, are we doing this again?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:53.250
Even though this is a very difficult question on par with Fermat's Last Theorem,

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:58.190
compared to our great plan, personal emotions and opinions are nothing.

00:07:58.850 --> 00:07:59.830
Which means...

00:08:00.490 --> 00:08:01.950
We're doing it again.

00:08:07.650 --> 00:08:11.110
Excuse me, Owner. Dinner has been prepared.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:13.620
I don't want it. Najimi doesn't want to eat.

00:08:13.900 --> 00:08:16.020
Owner, what's the matter?

00:08:17.030 --> 00:08:18.320
Girlish detected.

00:08:20.170 --> 00:08:21.180
Is it possible that...

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:23.980
No!

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:28.960
No! No! No!

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:31.510
Owner...

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.160
God damn it.

00:08:34.730 --> 00:08:39.930
There were no happy foreigners asking for directions, let alone another Akikan owner.

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.500
This world is weird.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:46.570
You're the weird one, right? What was with that "I am a genius"?

00:08:46.810 --> 00:08:50.770
Perhaps the enemy is a super genius who surpasses general wisdom?

00:08:52.470 --> 00:08:54.920
We'll just have to think of another way.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:56.120
Huh, just now!

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:59.510
What? Did a ghost just steal home?

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:02.350
There! That person! That aluminum can!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:02.800
Huh?

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:06.300
That sports drink girl? Where is she? In the bullpen?

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.160
In the broadcast stand?

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.330
No! She was walking through the crowd.

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:12.470
Was that her?

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:13.990
That person is a male!

00:09:13.990 --> 00:09:14.820
This person?

00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.320
That person is a male too!

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:17.270
Then this guy.

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:18.800
That person is totally a male.

00:09:19.300 --> 00:09:20.530
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:21.660
I'll get it this time...

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:22.820
As I was saying!

00:09:26.930 --> 00:09:28.770
Did I make a mistake?

00:09:29.050 --> 00:09:33.660
No. If she's sports drink girl, she must like sports.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:38.360
I see? Because she's sport's drink girl, she must like sports.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.960
All right. Let's check it out.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:43.100
She must be roaming back and forth in the streets.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:43.770
That's right.

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:50.030
Once we find her, we can follow her to find her owner. I really am a super genius.

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:09.780
So, Melon girl... What are we supposed to do with this portrait?

00:10:09.780 --> 00:10:11.000
It can't be helped.

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.820
This is my first time drawing.

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.170
Cute!

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:26.410
Not good. Not good. I'm in the middle of my mission.

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:33.050
Yes.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:33.970
This is Kizaki.

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.550
Is now a good time for you?

00:10:38.190 --> 00:10:39.240
Y-Yes.

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:44.810
We only spoke briefly about the Akikan Elect a couple days ago,

00:10:44.810 --> 00:10:47.370
so I want to explain it in more detail.

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:51.170
Najimi doesn't really care about the Akikan Elect...

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:54.030
Does your Akikan think that way?

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:55.610
Well...

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:00.410
But, but, Yell said she will listen to all of Najimi's orders.

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:04.940
Then I will talk about those matters as well today.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:07.210
Can you come to the place I am about to mention?

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.940
It's hopeless.

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:10.160
What wrong?

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.900
I'm really hungry, I'm really hungry. I can't walk anymore.

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:21.870
It can't be helped. I won't eat any, but why don't you go eat some grass over there?

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:27.070
All right! If it's this season, there are small eggplants, Asiatic plantain, and American lopseed.

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:30.760
The grass that grows for many years is much more delicious than grass that grows for one year.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.800
How can I eat those, you dented can!

00:11:33.390 --> 00:11:35.670
Who's the dented can? Bakakeru!

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:40.050
What did you say? Then I will let you taste my defense system.

00:11:40.440 --> 00:11:43.040
Ah, I can't do it. Not enough power.

00:11:43.220 --> 00:11:44.420
Melon!

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:48.950
Melons! Cheap! Cheap!

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:49.770
He said that you're cheap.

00:11:50.170 --> 00:11:52.020
It can't be true.

00:11:52.510 --> 00:11:57.490
Self-denial? It is important to accept yourself for who you are.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.950
Yo! The two of you.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.340
The melon is sweet and delicious. How about having one, bro?

00:12:03.760 --> 00:12:05.340
Then I'll have some.

00:12:06.560 --> 00:12:07.890
Itadakimasu.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:15.230
W-What's this feeling like a spring wind blowing in my mouth?

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:21.350
Moreover, the sweet, fresh juices are overflowing in succession, like a lovely girl!

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:23.750
It's too delicious!

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:26.300
My life is wonderful.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:30.220
Right? Come, the lady should also try some.

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.300
Hey, this lady-

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:35.860
This is fresh from the farm in Donelle. It's very ripe.

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.700
Well, you won't die from eating something almost the same as you.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.220
Here, here, Melon-chan.

00:12:41.480 --> 00:12:43.090
W-Wait.

00:12:43.090 --> 00:12:44.750
Don't be shy, don't be shy.

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:47.900
Jingle, jingle, come on, come on! Yes, say "Ah."

00:12:53.340 --> 00:12:56.510
She actually ate it. But will she be all right?

00:12:59.940 --> 00:13:01.170
It's delicious.

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:04.570
C-Cu...

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.470
Come, let's go.

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:13.050
All right, let's have all kinds of melon today.

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:16.240
Does melon bread taste like melon?

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:20.090
That's questionable, but in the near future, it will be on trial at the United Nations.

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:23.890
The taste is guaranteed to be delicious, so there won't be any problems with the trial.

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:27.580
What was it you said earlier?

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.950
Come on, you said, "C-Cu..." at the fruit stall.

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:36.090
Note: Kawaii (cute) vs kawa (rind)

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.980
Oh, about that, I just wanted to ask you if you wanted to try eating the rind.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.530
What is that?

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:40.190
Other than that, search for them properly.

00:13:40.190 --> 00:13:43.430
I am searching for them. Are you searching for them properly?

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:49.420
It can't be helped. How do we find them by using this portrait?

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.600
Do you remember any other characteristics?

00:13:53.940 --> 00:13:55.270
Let me see...

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.630
Well, her hair was silver.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.000
Hey, isn't that a very obvious characteristic?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.680
Hey, what's that?

00:14:06.060 --> 00:14:11.090
That is a ferris wheel. In a way, it's an amusement park's most exciting ride.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.320
Actually, there are countless dramas that were born from within it.

00:14:16.900 --> 00:14:20.660
Listen and be surprised! "The Earth Is Revolving Just for Me,"

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:24.570
and also "Girls Offer Their Bodies Just for Me," "All"-

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:27.390
Hey, hey, Kakeru. Why don't we ride that to search for her?

00:14:28.490 --> 00:14:31.370
When I'm giving such an explosive speech, at least let me finish!

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:34.210
All right. Don't be scared once you hear it. "The Earth Is"-

00:14:37.680 --> 00:14:38.540
Where do you want to go?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.430
Budoko!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:49.010
You!

00:14:50.180 --> 00:14:54.030
I have been granted this chance to exact my revenge! I won't forgive you today!

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:57.510
Hey, hey, don't fight in a place like this.

00:14:57.980 --> 00:14:58.860
New ultimate attack.

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:02.530
Grapefruit Bang!

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:07.950
It failed?

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:13.200
The two of you. I'm sorry for disturbing you in the middle of your excitement, but...

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.200
Grapefruit are not grapes!

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.950
No wonder I couldn't understand the technique of the attack.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:24.060
May I have your attention please.

00:15:24.780 --> 00:15:27.770
Budoko-san, Budoko-san.

00:15:27.770 --> 00:15:32.070
Please come to the front where your party is waiting.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:34.430
It's Misaki.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:37.450
I'm here, Misaki...

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.490
What? Was she lost?

00:15:45.860 --> 00:15:47.480
Awesome!

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:49.230
We're so high up!

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:52.240
Wait, did you forget our purpose for coming here?

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:00.940
Hey...

00:16:02.970 --> 00:16:03.890
That.

00:16:04.410 --> 00:16:09.320
Ah, that. It was originally supposed to be the World Cup's sports arena,

00:16:09.320 --> 00:16:12.590
but for some unknown reason, it's only used to play baseball.

00:16:13.790 --> 00:16:15.930
The game is about to start. Do you want to watch it?

00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:20.850
If you saw her there before, it's possible that you'll see her there again.

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:23.470
You want to watch baseball, right?

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.000
Is it okay?

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.290
All right!

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:27.780
Hey!

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:50.200
I'm on a mission. A mission.

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:02.280
It's me.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:07.280
I see. It seems your play is going well there, Airin-kun.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:08.640
It's Kizaki.

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:12.250
Good work. Today's mission is over.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:15.870
Later, capture a good man, and expose his disgraceful behavior.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:19.320
If it's a really good looking man, call me as well.

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:24.330
Please don't speak according to your own point of view. More importantly, won't you be seeing him off?

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:29.130
A foolish question. It's called "negligence play," one of the techniques.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:32.350
You won't last in the eyes of society.

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:36.800
To be honest, a woman wrapped in jealousy is ugly.

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:41.640
Also I don't want to cancel tonight's arrangement.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:45.610
I don't think ugliness is limited to females.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:49.870
I see now. Airin-kun prefers the same sex more than the opposite sex.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:54.850
I can no longer see where this conversation is going, so I'm going to hang up. Also, I'm Kizaki.

00:17:57.810 --> 00:18:02.900
What? Did she get angry because I struck a nerve? Meow?

00:18:05.300 --> 00:18:07.720
Isn't that great? It's a Taiga match.

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.800
It's because I act well normally.

00:18:09.930 --> 00:18:17.940
Note: Worshiped (ogamareru) vs chased (osowareru)

00:18:10.040 --> 00:18:15.070
If Melon behaves well, then an inexperienced person like me would be worshiped!

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:18.080
Huh? Don't you mean "chased"?

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:25.540
It should be around here...

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:37.790
Kakeru-chan, Melon-chan... Why are the two of them together?

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:45.350
Owner, I was dropped. I felt a big shock. Are you okay, Owner?

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:47.910
Owner! Owner!

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:50.050
What's wrong? Owner!

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.180
Ah, it was interesting.

00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:05.200
I'm hungry. Let's go to eat something.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.110
Where do you want to go?

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:41.750
Owner, what happened? You have such a grim face.

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:46.130
It was the fault of the boy called Kakeru, right?

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:52.090
Owner, please give me the order.

00:19:53.550 --> 00:19:56.610
Punish... Kakeru-chan.

00:19:57.860 --> 00:19:59.110
I understand.

00:20:09.590 --> 00:20:14.580
Welcome! Welcome! One piece costs 300 yen! Come and see!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:25.780
In the end, Melon mistook the vendor girl for the sports drink girl.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.670
With that, I'm suspicious about the silver hair characteristic...

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:32.230
Oh! Happy New Year, lady.

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.310
Thank you!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:40.160
That's weird. Melon's taking a while.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:42.520
I shouldn't have given her pocket money.

00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:48.310
But...

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:51.150
Well, days like this aren't bad.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.910
You are the worst man.

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.920
T-That was dangerous... It barely missed me.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:40.820
Kakeru~

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.000
What I want are

00:22:04.090 --> 00:22:05.800
a red handbag,

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:09.090
a long coat with a thorn design,

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:12.640
a cape that looks like a bird's crest,

00:22:12.720 --> 00:22:15.890
and a clip that clamps my hair!

00:22:15.970 --> 00:22:19.810
Encounter him, care a bit about him

00:22:19.890 --> 00:22:23.770
Eyes end with eyes, it's a miracle!

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:27.440
Everyone everyone everyone around and around

00:22:27.530 --> 00:22:31.570
Don't stop the cycle of love!

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:37.790
I'm calming down and calming others down warmly.

00:22:37.870 --> 00:22:39.460
Would you like some tea?

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:41.750
I want you to fill it

00:22:41.830 --> 00:22:43.420
with lots of love.

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:47.380
Don't be empty, Darling

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:51.340
We woke up with half a tatami each

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:54.760
when we slept on a whole tatami.

00:22:54.850 --> 00:22:55.680
Come on (kiss)

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:56.600
More (kiss)

00:22:56.680 --> 00:22:58.640
Forever (kiss kiss)

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:02.400
If you cheat on me, not only will I not kiss you, but I'll

00:22:58.730 --> 00:23:02.400
commit harakiri, whether you're a human or a can

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.320
When your heart is dry

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.990
We can meet anytime

00:23:14.980 --> 00:23:17.630
This is our destiny.

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.660
There's no way you would understand us.

00:23:20.050 --> 00:23:22.650
But we have to fight.

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:26.000
Because there are some things that cannot be achieved without fighting.

00:23:26.450 --> 00:23:29.140
So, farewell, Kakeru.
